        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Bugatti, Fabbrica Italiana Automobili Torino, Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV\n- People: Gianni Agnelli\n- Products: Bugatti Veyron, Supercar Challenge\n- Events: Ascari competition\n\nFacts:\n- Bugatti is the car brand that makes the Bugatti Veyron.\n- Supercar Challenge features an Ascari competition with five judges.\n- Gianni Agnelli is one of the five judges for the Ascari competition featured in Supercar Challenge.\n- Gianni Agnelli was the chairman of Fabbrica Italiana Automobili Torino.\n- Fabbrica Italiana Automobili Torino merged into the Netherlands-based holding company Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV.",
